# 🔍 What gets stored in DynamoDB

Each upload creates something like:

```json
{
  "unique": "random-id",
  "Bucket": "my-upload-bucket",
  "Object": "file.txt",
  "Size": 123,
  "Event": "ObjectCreated:Put",
  "EventTime": "2026-05-04T10:00:00Z"
}
```

